# CatDex Design System

**Source of truth:** `src/theme/` via `useTheme()` from `@/theme`. Never hardcode hex/rgba or ad-hoc spacing. Do not use tokens from `ChatDex Mobile App UI/` (Figma/web export).

```ts
import { useTheme } from '@/theme';
const { colors, spacing, radius, typography, shadow, gradients, motion, iconSize } = useTheme();
```

## Colors (white-first · soft purple brand)

| Token | Value | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `brand` / `textBrand` / `accent` / `primary` | `#6C63FF` | Headings, primary CTAs, active nav |
| `brandHover` | `#756CFF` | Hover purple |
| `brandPressed` / `accentPressed` | `#5C53F5` | Pressed purple |
| `brandSoft` / `accentSoft` | `#F0EFFF` | Soft purple tint |
| `background` / `surface` | `#FFFFFF` | App canvas |
| `surfaceSecondary` | `#F8F9FC` | Inputs, muted cards |
| `surfaceElevated` | `#FCFCFE` | Elevated cards / sheets |
| `ctaSecondary` | `#FFFFFF` | Secondary CTA fill |
| `ctaSecondaryBorder` | `#D7D9E2` | Secondary CTA border |
| `text` | `#181A25` | Primary ink |
| `textBody` | `rgba(24,26,37,0.78)` | Body copy |
| `textSecondary` | `#6F7283` | Supporting text |
| `textMuted` / `placeholder` | `#9CA0AF` | Metadata, placeholders |
| `border` | `#E5E7EB` | Subtle borders |
| `borderStrong` | `#D7D9E2` | Stronger control borders |
| `focusRing` | `#6C63FF` | Focus |
| `success` / `warning` / `danger` / `info` | semantic | States (+ Soft variants) |
| `tabBar` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.96)` | Bottom nav |
| `onAccent` / `onPrimary` / `onBrand` | `#FFFFFF` | On purple |

Coat / rarity accents: `src/lib/catTheme.ts` only — never as app chrome.
Rarity: Common `#8B95A7` · Rare `#3B82F6` · Epic `#8B5CF6` · Legendary `#F59E0B`.

**Gradients:** `primary` purple, `xp` purple→green. Avoid heavy multi-stop gradients.

## Typography

Fonts: iOS System (SF); Android/web Syne (display) + Manrope (body).

Use `<Text variant="…" color="…" />` — prefer `color="textBrand"` for titles.

| Variant | Size / Line / Tracking |
|---|---|
| `display` | 40 / 48 / -1.2 |
| `h1` | 32 / 40 / -0.8 |
| `h2` | 24 / 32 / -0.4 |
| `h3` | 20 / 28 / -0.2 |
| `title` | 18 / 24 / -0.15 |
| `body` | 16 / 24 / -0.1 |
| `bodySmall` | 14 / 20 / 0 |
| `caption` | 12 / 16 / 0.1 |
| `label` | 12 / 16 / 0.4 |
| `button` | 16 / 24 / -0.1 |

Avoid excessive uppercase.

## Spacing — 8pt grid

Allowed: `4 · 8 · 12 · 16 · 20 · 24 · 32 · 40 · 48 · 56 · 64 · 80 · 96`  
Screen padding `24` · card padding `16`/`24` · section gap `32` · button height `56`.

## Radius

| Token | Value |
|---|---|
| `xs` / `sm` / Small | `12` |
| `md` / Medium | `16` |
| `lg` / `cta` / Large | `20` |
| `xl` / `sheet` / Extra large | `28` |
| `pill` / `full` | `999` (circles only) |

## Elevation

Prefer borders + soft ink-tinted shadows: `shadow.none | low | medium | floating | glow`.  
Cards: border + `low`. FAB/nav: `medium`. Sheets: `floating`. Glow = purple FAB only.

## Motion / Icons

`fast≈140 · standard/normal≈220 · slow≈320 · reveal≈520`. Press `0.98` / card `0.99`.  
Icons: inline `react-native-svg`; sizes `sm=16 md=24 lg=32 xl=40`. Min touch target `44×44`.

## Components

- Prefer shared: `Text`, `Button` (`primary|secondary|outline|ghost|text|destructive|icon`), `TextInput`/`SearchInput`, `Card`/`PhotoCard`, `Chip`, `Badge`, `BottomSheet`, `EmptyState`, `Spinner`/`Skeleton`.
- Brand: **CatDex** — “Ton quartier. Tes chats.”

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<View style={{ backgroundColor: '#1a1a2e', padding: 13, shadowOpacity: 0.5 }} />

// ✅ GOOD
const { colors, spacing, radius, shadow } = useTheme();
<View style={[{ backgroundColor: colors.surface, padding: spacing.md, borderRadius: radius.lg, borderWidth: 1, borderColor: colors.border }, shadow.low]} />
<Text variant="h3" color="textBrand">Title</Text>
```
